        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They wandered into the sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;At the Mount Leng of Madness&quot; depicts the fear and conflict of students trapped in a cursed land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a visual novel that depicts the secrets of Mount Leng and the adventures of college students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >〇Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　The game also includes the following features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　　◆Animated movie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　　◆Select the text to progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　　◆As you progress through the game, you will be able to view your character's &quot;profile&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　　◆English and Japanese localization available</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　This game contains jumpscare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Some of the content is inspired by &quot;Exit 8&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >〇Character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Mehui Leisa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I just believe for it”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a central figure in the Occult Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And she has a past that no one knows about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Sarabe Chihiro</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey there. sup?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's a sociable and cheerful person, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and an asset to the diverse members of the Occult Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Tanba Harumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I now understand why Nietzsche said “God is sulking.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She likes to joke, but sometimes it can be annoying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that doesn't stop her from talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Edogawa En</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;...As you with.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the youngest and most serious member of the club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her eyes are wide because she's just nervous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >〇Gameplaay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >〇live game streaming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire main storyline is available for streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please be sure to read the Terms of Use before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Terms of Use can be viewed within the game.</p>",
