h\" >・Edogawa En</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;...As you with.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the youngest and most serious member of the club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her eyes are wide because she's just nervous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >〇Gameplaay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >〇live game streaming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire main storyline is available for streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please be sure to read the Terms of Use before playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Terms of Use can be viewed within the game.</p>",
